  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 15 October 2021). Our client Manoj Mishra is a 28-year-old textile trader who lives at Bungalow 7, Anna Nagar, Chennai 600056 and can be reached on 86619 19450 or manoj.mishra@example.com. The client's PAN DYXPM8761X, Aadhaar 9468 6628 3382.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Sandhu Textiles Pvt Ltd. A cheque for ₹43,60,000 issued by M/s Sandhu Textiles Pvt Ltd bounced: the cheque was dishonoured because the signature did not match.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 312449076635 (IFSC HDFC0542788).\nThe matter was filed as S.C.C. No. 655/2022 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at Chennai on 01/01/2022.",
